OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads not guilty to attempted
OL,4,Amurder of woman in stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded not guilty to the
OL,7,Fattempted murder of a woman in north
OL,8,FBelfast.
OL,10,FThe charges relate to a stabbing on 23
OL,11,FAugust 2024.
OL,13,FConneth Paul Johnston, 28, of
OL,14,FForthriver Park in Belfast, stood in
OL,15,Fthe dock of Belfast Crown Court on
OL,16,FWednesday as the charges were read out
OL,17,Fto him.
OL,19,FHe faces four charges dating back two
OL,20,Fyears, all of which he denies. He was
OL,21,Fremanded in custody.
